         coordinate in line3 is only ever set from the gated revealData
         payload (initReveal in the script below) — never present here. -->
    <div class="reveal-prologue" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="reveal-prologue-line1 mono" data-prologue="line1"></div>
      <div class="reveal-prologue-line2 mono" data-prologue="line2"></div>
      <div class="reveal-prologue-line3 mono" data-prologue="line3"></div>
    </div>
